<title>UK: Norwich Union names Biggs finance director.</title>
<headline>Norwich Union names Biggs finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurance group Norwich Union Plc said on Monday it had named Michael Biggs group finance director with effect from October.</p>
<p>Norwich Union said Biggs would succeed Richard Harvey, who will become group chief executive in January next year.</p>
<p>Biggs is currently group director (international) at Norwich Union.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
